  "storyText": "To be kind is good. The apple is here. The baby is here. The bag is here. The ball is here. The bed is here. The bird is here. The fish is here. The boy is here. Bread is warm. The bus is here. The cake is here. The car is here. The cat is here. The hat is here. The child is here. The city is here. The class is here. The clock is here. My clothes are clean. The cup is here. The day is here. The dog is here. The door is here. The egg is here. The family is here. The flower is here. The ice is here. The game is here. The girl is here. The hand is here. The house is here. The key is here. The kitchen is here. The letter is here. Milk is in the cup. Money is in my bag. The moon is here. The morning is here. The name is here. The night is here. The parent is here. The park is here. The pen is here. The picture is here. The room is here. The king is here. The shoe is here. The sister is here. The song is here. The table is here. To be kind is good. Come here, please. I do my homework. I drink water. I eat an apple. I find my key. I get a gift. I give Mom a flower. I go home. I have a book. I help my friend. I know your name. I like music. I look at the moon. I make a cake. The children play outside. I read a book. I run in the park. I see a bird. I sit on a chair. I sleep at night. I take a bus. I talk to my teacher. I walk to school. I write a letter. The ball is big. The ball is black. The ball is blue. The ball is clean. The ball is cold. The ball is fast. The ball is good. The juice is here. I am happy today. The ball is hot. The ball is little. The ball is long. The ball is new. The ball is old. The ball is red. The ball is sad. The ball is short. The ball is small. The ball is strong. The ball is tall. I am tired today. The ball is warm. The ball is white. The ball is yellow. The ball is young."
